      "writtenOn": "2022-03-23T23:32:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems okay, but I\u0027m cautious about dropping deferred logging since it would be easy to introduce latency problems due to logging in interrupts. It seems like the only potential issue is currently the power sequencing logging, but since this CPU doesn\u0027t support nesting interrupts that means every log statement that actually runs in an interrupt can easily block the entire system for hundreds of microseconds.",
      "parentUuid": "8106b36b_f5cf15b1",
      "revId": "42d999f9d42c3875386354b6fead89e1768eae16",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
